  "content": {
    "id": "p18-10b-q1-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Mahmoud wants to buy a new car, which is valued at $\\$45\\,000$. He could buy the car through an agreement with the car dealer or by borrowing the money from a bank.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p18-10b-q1-a",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "At the bank, Mahmoud asks for a loan of $\\$45\\,000$. The bank offers a loan at $7\\%$ p.a. simple interest to be repaid in equal monthly instalments for 5 years. Calculate:",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "p18-10b-q1-a-i",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "i",
            "prompt": "the amount of interest Mahmoud would pay",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\$15\\,750$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}I&=PRT\\\\I&=45\\,000\\times0.07\\times5\\\\I&=\\$15\\,750\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 24
          },
          {
            "id": "p18-10b-q1-a-ii",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "ii",
            "prompt": "the total amount to be paid by Mahmoud",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\$60\\,750$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total repayment}&=45\\,000+15\\,750\\\\\\text{Total repayment}&=\\$60\\,750\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 16
          },
          {
            "id": "p18-10b-q1-a-iii",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "iii",
            "prompt": "the amount to be paid each month",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\$1012.50$ per month",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Number of payments}&=5\\times12=60\\\\\\text{Monthly payment}&=60\\,750\\div60\\\\\\text{Monthly payment}&=\\$1012.50\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 24
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p18-10b-q1-b",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "At ‘BJ’s Car Sales’, Mahmoud is offered the following deal: pay $\\$5000$ in cash now and then 60 monthly instalments of $\\$934$, starting in a month’s time. Calculate:",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "p18-10b-q1-b-i",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "i",
            "prompt": "the total amount it would cost Mahmoud to buy the car this way",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\$61\\,040$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total cost}&=5000+60\\times934\\\\\\text{Total cost}&=\\$61\\,040\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 16
          },
          {
            "id": "p18-10b-q1-b-ii",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "ii",
            "prompt": "the rate of interest charged per annum, at simple interest, correct to 2 decimal places",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$8.02\\%$ p.a.\n\nThe principal is the car’s value less the cash deposit.",
              "worked": "The deposit reduces the amount financed.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P&=45\\,000-5000\\\\P&=\\$40\\,000\\\\I&=61\\,040-45\\,000\\\\I&=\\$16\\,040\\\\T&=60\\div12=5\\text{ years}\\\\16\\,040&=40\\,000\\times R\\times5\\\\R&=\\frac{16\\,040}{200\\,000}\\\\R&=0.0802=8.02\\%\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 58
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p18-10b-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Who offers the better deal, the car dealer or the bank?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The bank; its total cost is $\\$290$ less.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Saving with the bank}&=61\\,040-60\\,750\\\\\\text{Saving with the bank}&=\\$290\\end{align*}$$\nThe bank offers the better deal because the total repayment is lower.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      }
    ]
  },
